  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们正在吃点东西……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F8 0B}啊，队长。\n这里！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我刚才在向大家请教，\n什么是联谊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}毕竟还是小学生，不知道也正常。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}应该说，不知道才好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E3 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}哦，没想到你还挺讲道德？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}才不是……\n联谊只会让人尴尬到发冷。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 05 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}就是就是……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C3 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦？\n你们两个参加过同一场联谊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还有雪子、完二，\n以及{F5 C1 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}。\n是文化祭上的活动。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7C 08}啊，就是你们说的联谊咖啡厅？\n这点子真厉害啊。\n能在里面联谊，对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}没有凑成什么情侣吗？\n借着文化祭的气氛走到一起，\n不是很常见嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}当时抱着这种期待的我，真是个笨蛋……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，那样也挺有意思的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}真不愧是你，搭档……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 11 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 11}……联谊还真难理解呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}大多都很无聊啦。\n和不认识的人聊天，\n哪那么容易聊得热闹。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 39 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊，由加莉参加过啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C6 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}被朋友再三拜托，去过几次。\n还有被骗去的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}被骗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}比如说好一起吃蛋糕再回家，\n去了才发现是联谊。\n她们说，怕提前告诉我，我会拒绝。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，那多半有男生\n是冲着岳羽去的吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 84 08}真田学长也说过类似的事。\n本来以为去参加应援团会议，\n结果到场的全是女生。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……啦啦队？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}哈哈。\n不过听说他当场就回去了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:22:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}好像有人把他当成交换条件。\n说什么“我让你见真田，\n你就帮我做某某事”之类的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C1 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}月高也太厉害了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 03}不过，这里的联谊咖啡厅\n肯定和我们那次不一样吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:24:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}又不是真的举行联谊，\n应该不会弄得很尴尬吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯，也是……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 09 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 EB 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊，大家！\n在做什么熊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞小熊和玲走了过来……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊，麻烦的家伙来了……\n一听到联谊，那只熊肯定会来劲。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0A 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 0F 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}大家在做什么？\n比较巧克力香蕉的味道？\n那就选最里面左边第三个，准没错！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}光看就能知道吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:30:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个……我们什么也没干。\n嗯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 09 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 06 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}唔唔。\n很可疑熊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E5 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}比、比起那个，\n你没和善在一起呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 09 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 11}善去巡视了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:33:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我跟他说，我一个人也没问题。\n只要不进迷宫就没有危险，\n而且还有大家在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:33:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}善也一定觉得有大家在很开心。\n因为以前一直只有我们两个人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0332",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9F 10}善就拜托大家照顾了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D9 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}啊哈哈，当然。\n你们两个真是般配的情侣呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}情情情情侣什么的，才不是……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:36:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……看起来像吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:37:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 81 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}像啊熊。\n小玲和小熊，是情侣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:38:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8B 10}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}情侣不是应该\n彼此喜欢才行吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_038",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 71 07}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}小熊被委婉拒绝了熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:40:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 11 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以，你弄明白联谊是什么了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……完全没有。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_030.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_041",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和伙伴们度过了\n一段愉快的时光……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]